                    { id: "case-study", title: "Case Study Article", content: "Write a detailed case study including: background/context, problem statement, solution implemented, results achieved (with metrics), key learnings, and recommendations" },
                    { id: "how-to-guide", title: "How-To Guide", content: "Write a comprehensive how-to guide for [TASK/SKILL]. Structure: compelling introduction explaining why readers should care, what they'll achieve, required tools/materials, numbered step-by-step instructions with clear actions, screenshots or visual descriptions where helpful, pro tips and best practices, common mistakes to avoid, time/difficulty estimates, troubleshooting section, summary recap, and related next steps or advanced techniques" },
                    { id: "listicle", title: "Listicle Article", content: "Create an engaging listicle article: '[NUMBER] Ways/Tips/Reasons for [TOPIC]'. Include: catchy headline with number, brief introduction setting context and relevance, each list item with subheading, 100-200 words explanation per item, supporting examples or statistics, visual variety (mix of how-tos, tools, strategies), smooth transitions between items, actionable takeaways, compelling conclusion with CTA, optimal length 10-25 items for comprehensive coverage" },
                    { id: "product-review", title: "Product Review Post", content: "Write an honest and detailed product review for [PRODUCT]. Include: quick verdict summary (pros/cons, rating, who it's for), product overview and key features, detailed hands-on testing experience, performance across key use cases, comparison with similar products or alternatives, pricing and value assessment, who should buy vs who should skip, technical specifications, final recommendation, affiliate disclosure if applicable, FAQ section addressing common questions" },
                    { id: "comparison-post", title: "Comparison Article", content: "Create a comprehensive comparison article: '[PRODUCT A] vs [PRODUCT B]: Which Should You Choose?'. Structure: introduction explaining the comparison, side-by-side comparison table highlighting key differences, detailed breakdown of features/pricing/performance for each, strengths and weaknesses analysis, use case scenarios (when to choose A vs B), expert recommendation based on user needs, decision-making framework, visual comparisons, winner declaration for different categories, bottom-line recommendation" },
                    { id: "expert-interview", title: "Expert Interview Post", content: "Write an interview article featuring an expert in [FIELD]. Include: compelling introduction about the expert and why readers should care, expert's background and credentials, Q&A format with 8-12 thoughtful questions, questions covering: expert's journey, industry insights, practical advice, future predictions, controversial opinions, personal anecdotes, key takeaways highlighted throughout, pull quotes for emphasis, expert's contact/follow information, conclusion summarizing main insights, editor's note with context" },
                    { id: "research-based", title: "Research-Based Article", content: "Write a research-backed article on [TOPIC] with credible sources. Structure: hook with surprising statistic or finding, thesis statement, comprehensive research from academic journals, industry reports, and expert studies, minimum 10-15 credible sources cited, data visualization descriptions, multiple perspectives on the topic, debunking common myths with evidence, practical implications of research findings, limitations and areas needing more research, conclusion synthesizing key findings, properly formatted citations (APA/MLA), methodology note if original research" },
                    { id: "opinion-editorial", title: "Opinion/Editorial Piece", content: "Write a compelling opinion piece on [CONTROVERSIAL TOPIC]. Include: strong opening hook establishing your position, clear thesis statement, background context for readers unfamiliar with the issue, 3-5 main arguments supporting your position with evidence, acknowledgment of counterarguments and respectful rebuttal, personal anecdotes or experiences adding credibility, emotional appeal balanced with logic, call to action for readers, thought-provoking conclusion, disclaimer that views are personal opinion, invitation for respectful discussion" },
                    { id: "news-commentary", title: "News Commentary", content: "Write timely news commentary on [RECENT EVENT/DEVELOPMENT]. Structure: summary of the news/event for context, why this matters to your audience, expert analysis of implications, multiple stakeholder perspectives, historical context or similar past events, prediction of short-term and long-term impacts, actionable advice for readers affected, what to watch for next, balanced viewpoint avoiding sensationalism, links to primary news sources, update timestamp for developing stories, neutral tone with analytical depth" },
                    { id: "beginners-guide", title: "Beginner's Guide", content: "Create a beginner-friendly guide to [TOPIC/SKILL]. Include: welcoming introduction for complete beginners, clear explanation of what [TOPIC] is in simple terms, why it matters and benefits of learning it, common myths or misconceptions debunked, fundamental concepts explained with real-world analogies, glossary of essential terminology, step-by-step getting started roadmap, beginner-friendly tools and resources, realistic timeline and expectations, encouragement and motivation, what NOT to do as a beginner, next steps after mastering basics, FAQ section, encouragement that everyone starts somewhere" },
                    { id: "ultimate-guide", title: "Ultimate Guide", content: "Write a comprehensive ultimate guide to [TOPIC] (3000-5000+ words). Structure: executive summary with key takeaways, detailed table of contents with jump links, introduction establishing authority and completeness, foundations and fundamentals section, intermediate concepts and strategies, advanced techniques, tools and resources comparison, case studies and real examples, common FAQs answered, mistakes and how to avoid them, implementation roadmap, glossary of terms, further reading and references, regular updates note, downloadable resources or templates mentioned, conclusion with actionable next steps" },
                    { id: "pillar-content", title: "Pillar Content/Hub Page", content: "Create a pillar content page serving as comprehensive resource hub for [BROAD TOPIC]. Include: overview of the topic and why it matters, central comprehensive article (2000+ words) covering topic fundamentals, organized sections covering all subtopics, links to related in-depth articles (spoke content), visual content map showing topic relationships, resources section (tools, templates, guides), expert quotes and insights, statistics and data visualizations, regular update schedule commitment, internal linking strategy to related content, CTA for newsletter/course/guide, social proof (traffic, shares, testimonials)" },
                    { id: "content-series", title: "Blog Content Series Planner", content: "Plan a multi-part blog series on [TOPIC]. Create: series title and overarching theme, target audience and their journey, series structure with 4-8 part titles and descriptions, logical progression from basics to advanced, what each part will cover  (outline), how parts interconnect and build on each other, publishing schedule and frequency, consistent format/template for series, series landing page description, promotional strategy for series launch, ways to encourage readers to read all parts, series conclusion and next steps, metrics to measure series success, repurposing opportunities (ebook, course)" }
